# Bank export test fixtures are byte-exact copies of files a bank produced.
# Git's end-of-line normalisation would rewrite their CRLF terminators on
# checkout wherever `core.autocrlf` disagrees, and the fixtures exist precisely
# to prove the exporter emits CRLF. `-text` keeps the bytes as committed;
# `-diff` stops git from rendering a TIS-620 fixed-width record as text.
*/tests/fixtures/** -text -diff
